    {
      "@id": "skills/process/process-core/compiled-artefact-cache.md#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Instantiations",
      "prov:value": "| Aspect | Lean Cache (`lean-cache-restore`) | FHIR AST (`ig-ast-delta`) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Artefacts | `.olean` files, `.trace` files | Per-resource AST JSON, `dependencies.json`, `txcache/` |\n| Inputs Schema | `CompiledInputsSchema` | `CompiledInputsSchema` |\n| Key Inputs | `toolchain` (Lean version), `sourceRevision` | `toolchain` (Publisher version), `sourceRevision`, `inputDigest` |\n| Storage Branch | `lake-cache/<package>-<toolchain>` | `fhir-ast/<ig-package-id>` |\n| Service Script | `lake-cache.sh` (9 verbs) | `ig-cache.sh` (7 verbs) |\n| Refreshed by | an agent's `lake-cache.sh contribute` | a reusable workflow of the IG layer, on a runner (the Publisher needs Java and a 10 GB heap), which each IG repository dispatches; a site build refuses an AST that is not valid (owner, 2026-10-14) |\n| Cone Engine | Lake's `.trace`-based dependency graph | SUSHI's `fsh-index.json` (forward: file → resource) + `fsh-cone.ts` (reverse: who uses this file) + `AstPlanCli` |\n| Incremental | `lake build` (only stale modules) | `IncrementalBuildCli` (cone rebuild loop) |",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-14"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-14"
      ]
    },
